Package: luci-app-easytier-lite
Version: @VERSION@-1
Depends: libc, luci-base, luci-compat
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: thisxxx
Section: luci
Priority: optional
Description: LuCI page for easytier-lite, a minimal EasyTier node for home routers.
 Bundles the easytier-lite binary (DNS/STUN resolution and TCP hole punching
 enabled) with a procd service and a UCI-backed LuCI configuration page.
